  <span>
    <h1>Our <small>Story</small></h1>
    <P>
      Founded in 2023, Trinity Pharmacare Limited is a reputable pharmaceutical company based in the vibrant city of Ibadan, Oyo State, Nigeria. We have quickly become a trusted name in the industry, specializing in the wholesale, distribution, and marketing of pharmaceutical products and medical supplies for pharmacies, hospitals, and other healthcare providers.
    </P>
    <P>
      Our extensive portfolio includes a wide range of branded and generic pharmaceuticals, OTC items, surgical supplies, medical devices, and equipment. Committed to excellence, we bridge the gap between suppliers and healthcare providers, ensuring reliable service and allowing you to focus on delivering exceptional health outcomes.
    </P>
    <P>
      At Trinity Pharmacare Limited, we are more than just a pharmaceutical company; we are your partners in health, committed to making a positive difference in the lives of those we serve.
    </P>
    <p>
      <b>Dr. Peters I. Adonu <br> <i>CEO, Trinity Pharmacare Ltd.</i></b>
    </p>
